# OpenCode

- Personal OpenCode skills live under `~/.config/opencode/skills/`. Do not load
  personal skills through Claude-compatibility or `.agents` fallback paths;
  those contain other clients' implementations.
- OpenCode configuration, commands, and skills are loaded at process startup.
  Restart OpenCode after changing them.
- Use the OpenCode-specific `handoff` and `spinoff` skills. They preserve the
  shared handoff contract but launch a fresh OpenCode TUI with `--prompt`.
